---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "{{ title }}"
description: "{{ description }}"
---

<article class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 md:py-16">
  <div class="mb-6">
    <a href="/#products-collection" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-dark/70 hover:text-paprika transition">
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"/></svg>
      Back to All Butcher Cures
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 bg-white p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-micro border border-brand-border shadow-card">
    
    <!-- Left: Product Image & Badges -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col space-y-6">
      <div class="relative w-full aspect-square rounded-micro overflow-hidden bg-[#241512] border border-brand-border flex items-center justify-center p-8">
        {% if image %}
          <img src="{{ image }}" alt="{{ title }}" class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-micro" />
        {% else %}
          <svg class="w-full h-full" viewBox="0 0 400 400" fill="none">
            <rect width="400" height="400" fill="#1C1412"/>
            <path d="M60 120 C 120 70, 280 60, 340 110 C 370 200, 350 310, 310 350 C 200 380, 100 350, 60 300 Z" fill="#581F1A" stroke="#3D120E" stroke-width="4"/>
            <path d="M60 120 C 120 70, 280 60, 340 110 C 370 200, 350 310, 310 350" stroke="#CBB179" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="10 12"/>
            <path d="M120 160 Q 220 190 280 150" stroke="#F4EDE4" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.8"/>
            <path d="M100 240 Q 210 270 300 220" stroke="#F4EDE4" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.75"/>
            <path d="M140 290 Q 230 310 270 280" stroke="#F4EDE4" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.7"/>
            <circle cx="170" cy="180" r="4.5" fill="#D4AF37"/>
            <circle cx="210" cy="200" r="4" fill="#E8DEC8"/>
            <circle cx="240" cy="170" r="5" fill="#C59B27"/>
            <circle cx="190" cy="250" r="4" fill="#D4AF37"/>
          </svg>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 bg-slate-dark/90 text-white backdrop-blur text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-micro font-medium border border-white/10">
          Selection: <span id="pdp-visual-spec" class="text-amber-300 font-bold">{{ title }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-2 text-center">
        <div class="bg-parchment p-2.5 rounded-micro border border-brand-border">
          <span class="block text-base sm:text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-dark">52g</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-dark/60 tracking-wider">Protein/100g</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-parchment p-2.5 rounded-micro border border-brand-border">
          <span class="block text-base sm:text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-dark">0g</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-dark/60 tracking-wider">Added Sugar</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-parchment p-2.5 rounded-micro border border-brand-border">
          <span class="block text-base sm:text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-dark">100%</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-dark/60 tracking-wider">Prime Beef</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-parchment p-2.5 rounded-micro border border-brand-border">
          <span class="block text-base sm:text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-dark">Glatt</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-dark/60 tracking-wider">Kosher</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: PDP Options & Purchase Controls -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-micro text-xs font-bold bg-paprika/10 text-paprika border border-paprika/20">52g Protein</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-micro text-xs font-bold bg-olive/10 text-olive border border-olive/20">0g Sugar</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-micro text-xs font-bold bg-slate-dark/10 text-slate-dark border border-slate-dark/20">Gluten-Free</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-micro text-xs font-bold bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-800 border border-amber-500/20">Glatt Kosher</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-dark mb-2">
          {{ title }}
        </h1>
        
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <div class="flex text-amber-500">★★★★★</div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-dark">4.92 (482 verified customer reviews)</span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3 mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-brand-border">
          <span id="pdp-calculated-price" class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-dark">£{{ price }}</span>
          <span id="pdp-unit-price" class="text-xs text-slate-dark/60">Air-Cured Prime Cut</span>
          <span id="pdp-savings-badge" class="hidden text-xs font-bold text-paprika bg-paprika/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-micro">SAVE 15%</span>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-5">
          <!-- Texture Selector -->
          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-dark mb-2">
              1. Texture Profile: <span id="selected-texture-label" class="text-paprika font-medium">Moist (Tender &amp; Juicy)</span>
            </label>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2" id="texture-chips">
              <button type="button" data-val="Moist (Tender & Juicy)" class="texture-chip px-3 py-2.5 border-2 border-paprika bg-paprika/5 text-slate-dark font-medium text-xs rounded-micro transition text-center focus:outline-none">
                <span class="block font-bold">Moist</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-dark/70">Tender &amp; Juicy</span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" data-val="Traditional (Balanced)" class="texture-chip px-3 py-2.5 border border-brand-border bg-white text-slate-dark font-medium text-xs rounded-micro transition text-center hover:border-slate-dark focus:outline-none">
                <span class="block font-bold">Traditional</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-dark/70">Balanced Chew</span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" data-val="Dry (Firm Chew)" class="texture-chip px-3 py-2.5 border border-brand-border bg-white text-slate-dark font-medium text-xs rounded-micro transition text-center hover:border-slate-dark focus:outline-none">
                <span class="block font-bold">Dry</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-dark/70">Firm Old-School</span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Fat Profile Selector -->
          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-dark mb-2">
              2. Fat Profile: <span id="selected-fat-label" class="text-paprika font-medium">Traditional Rich Marbling</span>
            </label>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2" id="fat-chips">
              <button type="button" data-val="Traditional Rich Marbling" class="fat-chip px-3 py-2.5 border-2 border-paprika bg-paprika/5 text-slate-dark font-medium text-xs rounded-micro transition text-center focus:outline-none">
                <span class="block font-bold">Traditional Marbled</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-dark/70">Rich grass-fed fat cap</span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" data-val="Lean Cut" class="fat-chip px-3 py-2.5 border border-brand-border bg-white text-slate-dark font-medium text-xs rounded-micro transition text-center hover:border-slate-dark focus:outline-none">
                <span class="block font-bold">Lean Cut</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-dark/70">Ultra-trimmed silverside</span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Pack Size Selector -->
          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-dark mb-2">
              3. Pack Size: <span id="selected-size-label" class="text-paprika font-medium">{{ quantity[0] or '250g' }}</span>
            </label>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2" id="size-chips">
              <button type="button" data-val="100g" data-price="7.70" data-unit="£7.70 / 100g" class="size-chip px-3 py-2.5 border border-brand-border bg-white text-slate-dark font-medium text-xs rounded-micro transition text-center hover:border-slate-dark focus:outline-none">
                <span class="block font-bold">100g</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-dark/70">Snack (£7.70)</span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" data-val="250g" data-price="17.50" data-unit="£7.00 / 100g" class="size-chip px-3 py-2.5 border-2 border-paprika bg-paprika/5 text-slate-dark font-medium text-xs rounded-micro transition text-center focus:outline-none">
                <span class="block font-bold">250g</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-dark/70">Sharing (£17.50)</span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" data-val="500g" data-price="32.00" data-unit="£6.40 / 100g" class="size-chip px-3 py-2.5 border border-brand-border bg-white text-slate-dark font-medium text-xs rounded-micro transition text-center hover:border-slate-dark focus:outline-none">
                <span class="block font-bold">500g</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-dark/70">Bulk (£32.00)</span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Purchase Mode Toggle -->
          <div class="pt-2">
            <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-dark mb-2">
              4. Purchase Mode:
            </label>
            <div class="space-y-2">
              <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 border rounded-micro cursor-pointer border-brand-border hover:border-slate-dark transition bg-white" id="label-mode-onetime">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <input type="radio" name="purchase_mode" value="onetime" class="w-4 h-4 text-paprika focus:ring-paprika" checked onchange="updatePurchaseMode('onetime')">
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-dark">One-Time Purchase</span>
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-dark" id="mode-onetime-price">£{{ price }}</span>
              </label>

              <div class="p-3 border rounded-micro border-brand-border bg-white transition" id="label-mode-sub">
                <label class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <input type="radio" name="purchase_mode" value="subscription" class="w-4 h-4 text-paprika focus:ring-paprika" onchange="updatePurchaseMode('subscription')">
                    <div>
                      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-dark">Subscribe &amp; Save 15%</span>
                      <span class="block text-[10px] text-emerald-700 font-semibold">Cancel or pause anytime with 1-click</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold text-paprika" id="mode-sub-price">£14.88</span>
                </label>
                
                <div id="sub-cadence-wrapper" class="hidden mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-brand-border/60 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                  <span class="font-medium text-slate-dark">Delivery Frequency:</span>
                  <select id="sub-cadence" class="bg-parchment border border-brand-border rounded-micro px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium focus:outline-none focus:border-paprika">
                    <option value="2">Every 2 Weeks</option>
                    <option value="4" selected>Every 4 Weeks (Most Popular)</option>
                    <option value="8">Every 8 Weeks</option>
                  </select>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 space-y-3">
          <button id="pdp-add-to-cart-btn" type="button" onclick="handlePdpAddToCart()" class="w-full py-4 bg-paprika hover:bg-paprika-hover text-white font-bold text-base rounded-micro shadow-card transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 11V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4M5 9h14l1 12H4L5 9z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Add to Cart • <span id="cta-button-price">£{{ price }}</span></span>
          </button>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-center text-[11px] text-slate-dark/80 pt-1">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 p-2 bg-parchment rounded-micro border border-brand-border">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-olive" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>30-Day Freshness Guarantee</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 p-2 bg-parchment rounded-micro border border-brand-border">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-olive" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
              <span>Dispatched within 24 Hours</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Accordions -->
      <div class="mt-10 border-t border-brand-border divide-y divide-brand-border text-sm">
        <div class="accordion-item py-3">
          <button type="button" class="accordion-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-left text-slate-dark hover:text-paprika transition focus:outline-none" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Ingredients &amp; Allergen Disclosures</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 transform transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="accordion-content hidden pt-3 text-xs text-slate-dark/80 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
            <p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> 100% Prime Grass-Fed Beef Silverside (prepared with 240g of raw beef per 100g of finished biltong), Spirit Vinegar, Coarse Sea Salt, Toasted Cracked Coriander Seeds, Black Pepper, Nutmeg, Potassium Sorbate.</p>
            <p><strong>Allergens:</strong> Zero artificial additives, zero gluten, zero dairy, zero nuts, zero soy. Produced in a certified dedicated allergen-free craft meat facility.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion-item py-3">
          <button type="button" class="accordion-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-left text-slate-dark hover:text-paprika transition focus:outline-none" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Complete Nutritional Facts Panel (per 100g)</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 transform transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="accordion-content hidden pt-3 text-xs">
            <div class="border border-brand-border rounded-micro p-3 bg-parchment font-mono space-y-1">
              <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-brand-border pb-1 font-bold">
                <span>Energy</span>
                <span>1,180 kJ / 282 kcal</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-brand-border py-1 font-bold text-paprika">
                <span>Protein</span>
                <span>52.4g</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-brand-border py-1">
                <span>Fat (Total)</span>
                <span>7.8g</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-brand-border py-1 pl-4 text-slate-dark/70">
                <span>- of which Saturates</span>
                <span>3.1g</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-brand-border py-1 font-bold text-emerald-800">
                <span>Carbohydrates</span>
                <span>0.6g</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-brand-border py-1 pl-4 text-slate-dark/70">
                <span>- of which Sugars</span>
                <span>0.0g</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between pt-1">
                <span>Salt (Sodium equivalent)</span>
                <span>4.1g</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion-item py-3">
          <button type="button" class="accordion-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-left text-slate-dark hover:text-paprika transition focus:outline-none" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Kosher Certification Details</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 transform transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="accordion-content hidden pt-3 text-xs text-slate-dark/80 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
            <p>Certified Glatt Kosher Mehadrin under strict continuous supervision. All cattle are humanely handled, professionally checked (Bedikah), and soaked/salted in accordance with traditional halachic standards.</p>
            <p>Rabbinical Supervisor: <em>Rabbi D. Rose (Kashrut Division)</em>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion-item py-3">
          <button type="button" class="accordion-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-left text-slate-dark hover:text-paprika transition focus:outline-none" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Home Storage Guidelines</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 transform transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="accordion-content hidden pt-3 text-xs text-slate-dark/80 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
            <p>Our biltong contains no chemical drying stabilizers. For best mouthfeel and moisture preservation:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
              <li>Keep unopened pouches in a cool, dry, ventilated pantry.</li>
              <li>Once opened, consume within 4-5 days or store loosely in a brown paper bag in the refrigerator.</li>
              <li><strong>Freezer Safe:</strong> You may freeze unopened pouches for up to 12 months with zero loss in flavor or texture.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</article>
